---
title: Доклады — zolotyh.com
description: Видео выступлений Алексея Золотых на конференциях, митапах и подкастах.
layout: base.njk
lang: ru
---

<section class="talks">
  <h1>Доклады</h1>
  <p class="talks-lead">Видео выступлений на конференциях, митапах и подкастах.</p>

  {% for group in talks.byConference %}
    <section class="talks-group">
      <h2 class="talks-group-title">{{ group.conference }}</h2>
      {% for year in group.years %}
        <h3 class="talks-year-title">{{ year.year }}</h3>
        <div class="talks-grid">
          {% for talk in year.talks %}
            <article class="talks-card">
              <h4 class="talks-card-title">
                <a href="{{ talk.video }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ talk.title }}</a>
              </h4>
              {% if talk.tags %}
                <p class="talks-tags">
                  {% for tag in talk.tags %}
                    <span class="talks-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
                  {% endfor %}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="talks-video">
                <iframe src="{{ talk.embedUrl }}" title="{{ talk.title }}" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
              </div>
            </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
